r Sink?","src":"Barchart.com","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiugFBVV95cUxONmFtZjkzeDVMZmFMUHZUTkEwdzFmOHIxenFGZEhIaE9GV0NYLWVoeW5aS2ljS3lyYW9KQTlNR3d1LVY3WUtjZmVsZ0FkWnlTZGRjdWtnYTBkendrM082dVVXWE5uMFpYQ2hmYllFb3R6QmFlTkMtdkxKcEhVUWpwMmd2eC1hbE5LRnR2UzZFS2FnaUJDdVItT1ZZdWREX3BXWFdQcTJnMFpFQTZ4Y3R1cUJvSTc1bXVLclE?oc=5","date":"2026-11-19","zh":"華爾街分析師預測 Chubb Limited 股票會上漲還是下跌？"},{"title":"Chubb Limited Board Declares Quarterly Dividend","src":"TradingView","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirAFBVV95cUxPT0hJLXBQZXZXM3JhRHZyX3ZDLUdzVjNYeEZzMGxyQkhack1OMEV6emw1bV9fX083NnJDVHJIUHV3dXhTMWFtUTZUemVmSGVKVHdkM1JSbDBGNk5DY1FHZmlmWjZOUjhMSEFTOEZiMlc1RndVUkJQQVpydmNLUzVWREdEV29GUEM5VS0wUFZ6emtsaTlCYTFJMl83WGxoZXJ2T2dpVXVxMzZBWUNo?oc=5","date":"2026-11-19","zh":"安達有限公司董事會宣布季度股息"},{"title":"2,793 Chubb Limited $CB Shares Sold by Welch & Forbes LLC","src":"MarketBeat","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitAFBVV95cUxPR3N6RnFZOXZYek92eFUweWNVMDVIUHoyR2ZIOXN4RVpwbmxZd0tlOTFoc3lYTGRadWJCdURyLWVQRklKdmFSSmR4eTlaOEJzZHFLSHhnYUh6bmx0TVVZeWwwd1pfODJERGdzeEhuRmpTR0tmeDhlMFhwN3p0TnJ2NDhOTHJvWmwwOFh4RFJ5MUVIaDR2ZjhQYmtjS3FLdVlyRW8wbTZpMG9wRC1SWGFhRi1lbDM?oc=5","date":"2026-11-10","zh":"Welch & Forbes LLC 出售 2,793 股 Chubb Limited 美元 CB 股票"},{"title":"Final Trades: CF Industries, Morgan Stanley, Chubb Limited and ConocoPhillips","src":"CNBC","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxOb2JSeW04ZUQxVVMzTmkzbEZIQW93T29QcDVsS0gzRFhXaDluUTdEZGJKTGJrRHpwd0FGYzJka0tmZ0dDVUFEV1RQWDdMNUN1M2tOZF9paE1abWp6S25kczNDOXNUTlBIaHMtbGVDcDlrdy02bTRjZWFBX2pIQ3NpZ1pWTml2dzNVbnQ5VEVoZEh3UlpiRTBzZWRlbWtzT3p5UmI5TnNrNHNNYmJSY3U1UHhncnlHSkZ6?oc=5","date":"2026-11-05","zh":"最終交易：CF Industries、摩根士丹利、Chubb Limited 和康菲石油公司"}],"themes":[{"name":"財報","count":1},{"name":"股票回購/股利","count":1},{"name":"分析師評等","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-27","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/896159/000089615926000005/cb-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"Chubb Limited is the Swiss-incorporated holding company of the Chubb Group of Companies. Chubb Limited, which is headquartered in Zurich, Switzerland, and its direct and indirect subsidiaries (collectively, the Chubb Group of Companies, Chubb, we, us, or our) are a global insurance and reinsurance organization, serving the needs of a diverse group of clients worldwide. At December 31, 2025, we had total assets of $272 billion and total shareholders' equity, of $74 billion (excluding noncontrolling interests). Chubb was incorporated in 1985 at which time it opened its first business office in Bermuda and continues to maintain operations in Bermuda.","zh":"Chubb Limited 是 Chubb 集團公司在瑞士註冊成立的控股公司。安達有限公司 (Chubb Limited) 總部位於瑞士蘇黎世，及其直接和間接子公司（統稱為安達集團公司、安達、我們、我們或我們的）是一家全球性保險和再保險組織，為全球不同客戶群的需求提供服務。截至 2025 年 12 月 31 日，我們的總資產為 2,720 億美元，股東權益總額為 740 億美元（不含非控制權益）。 Chubb 於 1985 年成立，當時在百慕達開設了第一個業務辦事處，並繼續維持在百慕達的業務。"},{"en":"We have grown our business through increased premium volume, expansion of product offerings and geographic reach, and the acquisition of other companies, to become a global property and casualty (P&C) leader. We expanded our personal accident and supplemental health (A&H), and life insurance business with the acquisition of Cigna's business in several Asian markets in 2022. We further advanced our goal of greater product, customer, and geographical diversification with incremental purchases that led to a controlling majority interest in Huatai Insurance Group Co. Ltd (Huatai Group), a Chinese financial services holding company with separate P&C, life, and asset management subsidiaries (collectively, Huatai) on July 1, 2023. At December 31, 2025, our ownership interest in Huatai Group was approximately 87.2 percent. Refer to Note 2 to the Consolidated Financial Statements for additional i","zh":"我們透過增加保費數量、擴大產品種類和地理覆蓋範圍以及收購其他公司來發展我們的業務，成為全球財產和意外傷害 (P&C) 的領導者。我們於 2022 年收購了 Cigna 在多個亞洲市場的業務，從而擴大了我們的個人意外和補充健康保險 (A&H) 以及人壽保險業務。我們透過增量收購進一步推進了產品、客戶和地理多元化的目標，最終於 2023 年 7 月 1 日獲得了華泰保險集團有限公司（華泰集團）的控股權。華泰集團是一家中國金融服務控股公司，擁有獨立的財產險、壽險和資產管理子公司（統稱為華泰）。截至2025年12月31日，我們在華泰集團的所有權權益約為87.2%。附加資訊請參閱合併財務報表附註2"},{"en":"With operations in 54 countries and territories, Chubb provides commercial and consumer P&C insurance, A&H, reinsurance, and life insurance to a diverse group of clients. We provide commercial insurance products and service offerings such as risk management programs, loss control, and engineering and complex claims management. We provide specialized insurance products ranging from Directors & Officers (D&O) and financial lines to various specialty-casualty and umbrella and excess casualty lines to niche areas such as aviation and energy. We also offer consumer lines insurance coverage including homeowners, automobile, valuables, umbrella liability, and recreational marine products. In addition, we supply A&H and life insurance to individuals in select countries.","zh":"Chubb 的業務遍及 54 個國家和地區，為不同的客戶群提供商業和消費者財產與意外險、健康險、再保險和人壽保險。我們提供商業保險產品和服務，例如風險管理計劃、損失控制以及工程和複雜索賠管理。我們提供專業保險產品，從董事和高階主管 (D&O) 和金融險種到各種特殊傷亡、保護傘險和超額傷亡險，再到航空和能源等利基領域。我們也提供消費者保險，包括房屋保險、汽車保險、貴重物品保險、雨傘責任保險和休閒海洋產品保險。此外，我們也向特定國家/地區的個人提供 A&H 和人壽保險。"}],"markets":[{"en":"The Commercial Insurance operations provide a broad range of P&C, financial lines, and A&H products targeted to U.S and Canadian-based middle market and small commercial customers in a variety of industries. In 2025, the North America Small & Lower Midmarket Division was established to leverage a modern, automated, and data-centric digital operating model, enhancing our service delivery and product offerings to our small and lower middle market customers.","zh":"商業保險業務針對美國和加拿大各行業的中型市場和小型商業客戶提供廣泛的財產險、金融險種以及 A&H 產品。 2025 年，北美中小型和中低端市場部門成立，旨在利用現代化、自動化和以數據為中心的數位營運模式，增強我們為中小型和中低端市場客戶提供的服務交付和產品。"},{"en":"Commercial Insurance products and services offered to our upper middle market customers include traditional P&C lines of business, including Package, which combines property and general liability, workers' compensation, automobile, umbrella; financial lines of business, including professional liability, management liability and cyber risk coverage; and other lines including environmental, A&H, and international coverages. Commercial Insurance distributes its insurance products through a North American network of independent retail agents and regional, multinational and digital brokers. Generally, our customers purchase insurance through a single retail agent or broker, do not employ a risk management department, and do not retain significant risk through self-insured retentions. The majority of our customers purchase a package product or a portfolio of products, which is a collection of ","zh":"我們向中高端市場客戶提供的商業保險產品和服務包括傳統的財產和意外險業務線，包括結合財產和一般責任的套餐、工人賠償、汽車、雨傘；金融業務，包括專業責任、管理責任和網路風險保險；以及其他線路，包括環境、A&H 和國際報告。 Commercial Insurance 透過北美獨立零售代理商以及區域、跨國和數位經紀人網路分銷其保險產品。一般來說，我們的客戶透過單一零售代理商或經紀人購買保險，不僱用風險管理部門，並且不會透過自我保險保留來保留重大風險。我們的大多數客戶購買套裝產品或產品組合，這是產品的集合"}],"customers":[{"en":"We have grown our business through increased premium volume, expansion of product offerings and geographic reach, and the acquisition of other companies, to become a global property and casualty (P&C) leader. We expanded our personal accident and supplemental health (A&H), and life insurance business with the acquisition of Cigna's business in several Asian markets in 2022. We further advanced our goal of greater product, customer, and geographical diversification with incremental purchases that led to a controlling majority interest in Huatai Insurance Group Co. Ltd (Huatai Group), a Chinese financial services holding company with separate P&C, life, and asset management subsidiaries (collectively, Huatai) on July 1, 2023. At December 31, 2025, our ownership interest in Huatai Group was approximately 87.2 percent. Refer to Note 2 to the Consolidated Financial Statements for additional i","zh":"我們透過增加保費數量、擴大產品種類和地理覆蓋範圍以及收購其他公司來發展我們的業務，成為全球財產和意外傷害 (P&C) 的領導者。我們於 2022 年收購了 Cigna 在多個亞洲市場的業務，從而擴大了我們的個人意外和補充健康保險 (A&H) 以及人壽保險業務。我們透過增量收購進一步推進了產品、客戶和地理多元化的目標，最終於 2023 年 7 月 1 日獲得了華泰保險集團有限公司（華泰集團）的控股權。華泰集團是一家中國金融服務控股公司，擁有獨立的財產險、壽險和資產管理子公司（統稱為華泰）。截至2025年12月31日，我們在華泰集團的所有權權益約為87.2%。附加資訊請參閱合併財務報表附註2"}],"competition":[{"en":"The Commercial Insurance operations compete against numerous insurance companies ranging from large national carriers to small and mid-size insurers who provide specialty coverages and standard P&C products. Major Accounts competes against large, global carriers; regional competitors; and self-insured retentions and captive programs. The markets are subject to cycles of fluctuating capacity and price adequacy. We pursue a specialist strategy and focus on market opportunities where we can compete effectively. We also achieve a competitive advantage through Major Accounts' innovative product offerings and our ability to provide multiple products to a single client. In addition, all our domestic commercial units deliver global products and coverage to customers.","zh":"商業保險業務與眾多保險公司競爭，從大型國家保險公司到提供專業保險和標準財產保險產品的中小型保險公司。主要客戶與大型全球營運商競爭；區域競爭對手；以及自我保險保留和自保計劃。市場受到容量波動和價格充足性週期的影響。我們奉行專業策略，專注於能有效競爭的市場機會。我們也透過大客戶的創新產品以及向單一客戶提供多種產品的能力獲得了競爭優勢。此外，我們所有的國內商業部門都為客戶提供全球產品和覆蓋範圍。"},{"en":"The North America Personal P&C Insurance segment includes the business written by Chubb Personal Risk Services division (PRS), which includes high-net-worth personal lines business, with operations in the U.S. and Canada. This segment provides affluent and high-net-worth individuals and families with homeowners, high value automobile and collector cars, valuable articles (including fine arts), personal and excess liability/umbrella, travel insurance, cyber, and recreational marine insurance and services. Our homeowners business, including valuable articles, represented 69 percent of North America Personal P&C Insurance's net premiums earned in 2025.","zh":"北美個人財產和意外傷害保險部門包括 Chubb 個人風險服務部門 (PRS) 的業務，其中包括高淨值個人保險業務，業務遍及美國和加拿大。此細分市場為富裕和高淨值個人和家庭提供房主、高價值汽車和收藏車、貴重物品（包括藝術品）、個人和超額責任/雨傘、旅遊保險、網路和休閒海上保險和服務。我們的房屋所有權人業務（包括貴重物品）佔 2025 年北美個人財產保險淨保費收入的 69%。"}],"segments":{},"peers":["CINF","AFL","PGR","ALL","APD"]}}